<title>USA: Matthews International Q2 oper net rises.</title>
<headline>Matthews International Q2 oper net rises.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In Thousands, except Share Data)</p>
<p>				 Three Months Ended  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>			  3/31/97     3/31/96    3/31/97    3/31/96</p>
<p> Sales		   $45,427    $42,792    $88,010    $83,977</p>
<p> Operating Profit	7,885	6,847     14,499     13,299</p>
<p> Net Income		5,013	7,376	9,317     11,622</p>
<p> Earnings per Share     0.58	 0.83	 1.07	 1.31</p>
