<p>Adjusted Earnings</p>
<p>  per Share		 0.58	 0.50	 1.07	 0.98</p>
<p>Weighted Average</p>
<p>  Shares	     8,663,327  8,880,821  8,702,452  8,867,762</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said last year's net includes a one-time gain of $0.33 per share related to the sale of its cemetery and mortuary in Arizona.</p>
